WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.386 --> 00:00:02.092
ALL THIS.

00:00:02.103 --> 00:00:04.441
&gt;&gt; John: A LOT TO BE PROUD IN

00:00:04.452 --> 00:00:05.669
THE PEACH STATE TODAY.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.249
&gt;&gt; Sandra: CONGRATS.

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:09.111
&gt;&gt; SLAP ON THE FACE.

00:00:09.122 --> 00:00:11.502
WE ARE IN THE MIDST OF A CRISIS.

00:00:11.536 --> 00:00:12.963
WE SEE IT EVERY DAY.

00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:14.681
BIDEN WAS NOT COMING TO SEE THE

00:00:14.692 --> 00:00:15.934
REALITY OF THE BORDER.

00:00:15.945 --> 00:00:17.916
HE WAS COMING TO SEE A

00:00:17.927 --> 00:00:19.559
SANITIZED, A CLEAN EL PASO.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.612
WHAT WAS THE PRICE THEY PROMISED

00:00:21.623 --> 00:00:24.011
THEM TO BE ABLE TO CLEAN THIS UP

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:26.011
AND MAKE BIDEN LOOK GOOD?

00:00:26.022 --> 00:00:28.560
&gt;&gt; Sandra: IN EL PASO, TEXAS,

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:30.787
THAT WAS IN EL PASO, TEXAS,

00:00:30.798 --> 00:00:31.960
RESIDENT FURIOUS AT PRESIDENT

00:00:31.994 --> 00:00:33.498
BIDEN AFTER HIS TOUR OF THE

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.455
BORDER TOWN ON SUNDAY.

00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:36.576
LOCALS SAYING THE PRESIDENT DID

00:00:36.587 --> 00:00:39.539
NOT SEE THE FULL EXTENT OF THE

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.624
CRISIS THERE, MANY MIGRANT CAMPS

00:00:41.635 --> 00:00:42.875
WERE TORN DOWN BEFORE HE

00:00:42.886 --> 00:00:43.349
ARRIVED.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.964
AND JOINING US NOW IS PRESIDENT

00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:47.544
AND CEO OF THE UNITED STATES

00:00:47.555 --> 00:00:48.476
HISPANIC BUSINESS COUNCIL.

00:00:48.487 --> 00:00:50.660
THANK YOU VERY MUCH FOR COMING

00:00:50.694 --> 00:00:52.155
BACK ON THE PROGRAM.

00:00:52.156 --> 00:00:54.088
OUR VIEWERS REALLY APPRECIATED

00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:56.192
THE LAST TIME YOU JOINED US.

00:00:56.227 --> 00:00:57.333
YOU ARE INCREDIBLY PASSIONATE

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:59.369
ABOUT WHAT IS HAPPENING THERE,

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:01.044
YOU PLACED A LOT OF URGENCY ON

00:01:01.055 --> 00:01:01.554
THAT, SIR.

00:01:01.565 --> 00:01:03.414
WHAT DID YOU MAKE OF THE

00:01:03.425 --> 00:01:05.441
PRESIDENT’S VISIT, FIRST OF ALL.

00:01:05.452 --> 00:01:07.562
IS THIS GOING TO HELP ANYTHING?

00:01:07.596 --> 00:01:10.345
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I HAVE TO SAY THAT

00:01:10.346 --> 00:01:11.725
I’VE BEEN CRITICAL OF THIS

00:01:11.726 --> 00:01:13.434
ADMINISTRATION’S HANDLING OF

00:01:13.435 --> 00:01:16.053
THAT CRISIS AND AFTER MONTHS OF

00:01:16.054 --> 00:01:17.840
MYSELF AND OTHERS CALLING FOR

00:01:17.841 --> 00:01:19.977
THE PRESIDENT TO COME DOWN TO

00:01:19.988 --> 00:01:21.236
THE BORDER AND VISIT THE

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.870
AMERICANS WHO ARE SUFFERING

00:01:22.904 --> 00:01:24.913
THROUGH THIS CRISIS HE FINALLY

00:01:24.914 --> 00:01:28.299
CAME, SO CREDIT WHERE CREDIT IS

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:30.668
DUE, BUT HONESTLY, A THREE-HOUR

00:01:30.679 --> 00:01:32.376
SCRIPTED SANITIZED VISIT, THAT’S

00:01:32.387 --> 00:01:34.102
NOT A SOLUTION.

00:01:34.113 --> 00:01:35.517
THAT’S A PHOTO OP.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:38.715
AND WE ARE CALLING FOR A LOT

00:01:38.726 --> 00:01:40.467
MORE THAN THIS, YOU KNOW.

00:01:40.478 --> 00:01:42.666
HE -- HE -- I UNDERSTAND THAT

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.986
JOE BIDEN DID NOT CREATE THIS

00:01:44.988 --> 00:01:46.747
PROBLEM, IT’S NOT HIS FAULT.

00:01:46.758 --> 00:01:48.404
BUT IT IS HIS RESPONSIBILITY.

00:01:48.415 --> 00:01:49.879
&gt;&gt; Sandra: REALLY INTERESTING.

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:51.515
THIS IS THE WHITE HOUSE

00:01:51.526 --> 00:01:53.817
DESCRIPTION OF THE PRESIDENT’S

00:01:53.851 --> 00:01:55.769
NEW BORDER POLICIES IMPOSING NEW

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:58.085
CONSEQUENCES FOR INDIVIDUALS WHO

00:01:58.096 --> 00:02:00.125
ATTEMPT TO ENTER UNLAWFULLY,

00:02:00.136 --> 00:02:02.496
EXPANDING LEGAL PATHWAYS FOR

00:02:02.507 --> 00:02:04.588
SAFE, ORDERLY AND HUMAN

00:02:04.599 --> 00:02:05.437
MIGRATION.

00:02:05.448 --> 00:02:09.451
THEY ALSO SAY THE SURGE --

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:11.165
SECURING SURGE RESOURCES,

00:02:11.176 --> 00:02:12.491
DISRUPT CRIMINAL SMUGGLING

00:02:12.525 --> 00:02:13.659
NETWORKS AND SUPPORTING BORDER

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:14.443
COMMUNITIES.

00:02:14.454 --> 00:02:17.181
WILL ANY OF THIS HELP?

00:02:17.192 --> 00:02:19.437
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I THINK IT MAY

00:02:19.448 --> 00:02:20.150
HELP.

00:02:20.152 --> 00:02:22.423
POLICY IS ONE THING, ENFORCEMENT

00:02:22.457 --> 00:02:24.506
IS ANOTHER.

00:02:24.507 --> 00:02:28.128
YOU KNOW, THIS NOTION OF SENDING

00:02:28.139 --> 00:02:30.116
30,000 MIGRANTS BACK TO MEXICO

00:02:30.127 --> 00:02:31.681
IS A DROP IN THE BUCKET.

00:02:31.714 --> 00:02:33.530
IT WILL HELP AND RIGHT NOW WE’LL

00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:35.626
TAKE ANY HELP WE CAN GET.

00:02:35.637 --> 00:02:38.000
BUT IT’S A DROP IN THE BUCKET

00:02:38.011 --> 00:02:40.640
COMPARED TO THE 1.5 MILLION WHO

00:02:40.651 --> 00:02:41.787
ARE ALREADY HERE AWAITING

00:02:41.788 --> 00:02:42.263
PROCESSING.

00:02:42.274 --> 00:02:45.369
IN ADDITION TO THAT, WE HAVE

00:02:45.403 --> 00:02:48.040
600,000 PEOPLE CLAIMING ASYLUM.

00:02:48.051 --> 00:02:49.935
THAT PROCESS ALONE IS ESTIMATED

00:02:49.946 --> 00:02:51.681
TO TAKE UP TO FOUR YEARS TO

00:02:51.692 --> 00:02:52.267
CLEAN UP.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.360
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO WITH

00:02:54.371 --> 00:02:55.659
THESE PEOPLE IN THE MEANTIME?

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:58.443
AND AT THE SAME TIME THAT THIS

00:02:58.454 --> 00:02:59.691
IS HAPPENING, OUR FARMERS ARE

00:02:59.725 --> 00:03:00.597
SUFFERING.

00:03:00.598 --> 00:03:04.637
LAST YEAR WE LOST 10 MILLION

00:03:04.639 --> 00:03:06.807
TONS OF CROPS THAT WENT

00:03:06.818 --> 00:03:08.555
UNHARVESTED BECAUSE WE COULDN’T

00:03:08.566 --> 00:03:10.150
GET PEOPLE TO HARVEST THOSE

00:03:10.184 --> 00:03:11.907
CROPS FOR US.

00:03:11.918 --> 00:03:13.554
SO WE NEED THE PRESIDENT’S

00:03:13.565 --> 00:03:14.198
ATTENTION.

00:03:14.209 --> 00:03:15.636
WE NEED SOME THOUGHTFUL

00:03:15.647 --> 00:03:17.803
RESOLUTION TO THIS, SOMETHING

00:03:17.814 --> 00:03:19.525
THAT IS SUSTAINABLE, THAT WILL

00:03:19.536 --> 00:03:21.870
HELP THE AMERICAN PEOPLE AND THE

00:03:21.881 --> 00:03:22.506
AMERICAN ECONOMY.

00:03:22.517 --> 00:03:24.211
&gt;&gt; Sandra: THIS IS SENATOR JAMES

00:03:24.222 --> 00:03:25.914
LANGEFORD ON WHAT HE SAYS THE

00:03:25.925 --> 00:03:27.588
PRESIDENT DID NOT DO WITH THIS

00:03:27.599 --> 00:03:28.443
BORDER VISIT.

00:03:28.477 --> 00:03:30.157
&gt;&gt; HE DIDN’T MEET WITH THE

00:03:30.168 --> 00:03:31.481
BORDER PATROL UNION OR THE LAND

00:03:31.515 --> 00:03:32.904
OWNERS OF THE AREA, DID NOT MEET

00:03:32.915 --> 00:03:33.648
WITH MIGRANTS.

00:03:33.683 --> 00:03:35.150
THIS WAS A STAGED EVENT HE

00:03:35.151 --> 00:03:37.332
BROUGHT IN ON SUNDAY TO SAY

00:03:37.343 --> 00:03:39.462
LOOK, I WENT, BUT HE’S NOT GOING

00:03:39.473 --> 00:03:40.900
TO TRY TO SAY WHAT NEEDS TO BE

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:41.278
FIXED.

00:03:41.312 --> 00:03:42.935
&gt;&gt; Sandra: ECHOING THE COMMENTS

00:03:42.946 --> 00:03:44.701
WE HEARD FROM YOU JUST NOW.

00:03:44.712 --> 00:03:45.895
YOU’VE REACHED OUT TO THE WHITE

00:03:45.897 --> 00:03:46.429
HOUSE.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.163
ARE YOU IN COMMUNICATION WITH

00:03:48.164 --> 00:03:50.205
THE PRESIDENT AND HIS TEAM AT

00:03:50.216 --> 00:03:51.455
ALL ABOUT THESE ISSUES?

00:03:51.466 --> 00:03:53.184
&gt;&gt; WE ARE TO SOME EXTENT.

00:03:53.195 --> 00:03:54.591
BUT THE REALITY OF IT IS, YOU

00:03:54.602 --> 00:03:56.064
KNOW, THEY WANT TO LISTEN TO THE

00:03:56.075 --> 00:03:57.923
PEOPLE THEY WANT TO LISTEN TO.

00:03:57.934 --> 00:03:59.533
AND LISTEN, I GET IT.

00:03:59.544 --> 00:04:01.267
JOE BIDEN HAS THE TOUGHEST JOB

00:04:01.278 --> 00:04:02.718
IN THE WORLD.

00:04:02.752 --> 00:04:04.030
BUT LET’S NOT FORGET.

00:04:04.041 --> 00:04:05.628
HE ASKED FOR THIS JOB.

00:04:05.639 --> 00:04:08.524
WE GAVE HIM THE JOB AND NOW IT’S

00:04:08.557 --> 00:04:10.808
TIME FOR HIM TO DO THE JOB.

00:04:10.819 --> 00:04:12.477
THIS IS A DIFFICULT VERY, YOU

00:04:12.488 --> 00:04:14.146
KNOW, IT’S GOING TO TAKE SOME

00:04:14.157 --> 00:04:15.593
THOUGHT, IT’S GOING TO TAKE SOME

00:04:15.594 --> 00:04:17.428
LEADERSHIP, HE’S GOING TO HAVE

00:04:17.439 --> 00:04:19.410
TO REACH ACROSS THE AISLE.

00:04:19.444 --> 00:04:21.124
NOT A SINGLE REPUBLICAN WAS

00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:23.100
INVITED TO THAT VISIT.

00:04:23.111 --> 00:04:25.235
WHERE WERE OUR TWO SENATORS IN

00:04:25.246 --> 00:04:27.444
TEXAS, WHERE WERE THE TEXAS

00:04:27.455 --> 00:04:28.973
REPUBLICAN MEMBERS OF CONGRESS.

00:04:28.984 --> 00:04:30.824
WE NEED A LEADER THAT

00:04:30.835 --> 00:04:32.258
UNDERSTANDS THE ISSUE, THAT’S

00:04:32.269 --> 00:04:34.775
TALKING TO THE AMERICANS ON THE

00:04:34.809 --> 00:04:36.627
BORDER, THE FARMERS, THE

00:04:36.638 --> 00:04:38.669
DOCTORS, THE NURSES, THE POLICE

00:04:38.703 --> 00:04:39.911
OFFICERS, THE TEACHERS, THE

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:41.118
AMERICANS THAT ARE SUFFERING

00:04:41.129 --> 00:04:42.542
THROUGH THIS CRISIS.

00:04:42.575 --> 00:04:44.538
THEY WILL BEST INFORM HIS

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:47.996
STRATEGY FOR HOW TO MOVE

00:04:47.997 --> 00:04:49.946
FORWARD, NOT HIS INSULATED IVY

00:04:49.947 --> 00:04:51.501
LEAGUE-EDUCATED CIRCLE OF SIX.

00:04:51.502 --> 00:04:54.813
HE NEEDS TO GET BEYOND THAT AND

00:04:54.814 --> 00:04:56.339
TALK TO REAL AMERICANS HOW WE

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.655
MOVE FORWARD HERE.

00:04:57.666 --> 00:04:59.904
&gt;&gt; Sandra: JAVIER, I ONLY HAVE A

00:04:59.938 --> 00:05:02.408
COUPLE SECONDS LEFT, AND PEOPLE

00:05:02.419 --> 00:05:04.896
ARE LISTENING, AND BY THE WAY,

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:07.343
THE LAST TIME YOU JOINED US WE

00:05:07.344 --> 00:05:08.913
DIDN’T ASK BUT YOU VOTED FOR

00:05:08.924 --> 00:05:10.718
PRESIDENT BIDEN AND YOU PUT HIM

00:05:10.729 --> 00:05:12.409
IN OFFICE AND ALSO SAID AT THE

00:05:12.443 --> 00:05:13.872
END OF THE LAST INTERVIEW WE HAD

00:05:13.873 --> 00:05:15.204
WITH YOU THAT DEMOCRATS ARE

00:05:15.215 --> 00:05:17.241
GOING TO MAKE A REPUBLICAN OUT

00:05:17.275 --> 00:05:20.396
OF YOU OVER THIS BORDER CRISIS.

00:05:20.398 --> 00:05:22.943
HAS THERE BEEN ANY CHANGE THERE?

00:05:22.954 --> 00:05:24.238
DO YOU --

00:05:24.249 --> 00:05:25.799
&gt;&gt; SADLY THERE HAS NOT.

00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:27.991
I’M WAITING FOR JOE BIDEN TO

00:05:28.002 --> 00:05:30.680
STEP OUT OF THE INNER CIRCLE, TO

00:05:30.691 --> 00:05:32.974
STEP OUT OF THE BELTWAY AND DEAL

00:05:32.985 --> 00:05:35.176
WITH THE AMERICAN PEOPLE, HEAR

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.374
FROM US, HEAR FROM REPUBLICANS

00:05:36.385 --> 00:05:38.772
THAT ARE ON THE BORDER THAT ARE

00:05:38.783 --> 00:05:41.103
SUFFERING THROUGH THIS.  IT CAN

00:05:41.114 --> 00:05:43.998
BE DONE, THIS IS HIS MOMENT.

00:05:44.009 --> 00:05:46.546
HE CAN ILLUSTRATE HE’S THE

00:05:46.557 --> 00:05:48.457
LEADER HE PROMISED HE WAS GOING

00:05:48.468 --> 00:05:50.764
TO BE.

00:05:50.775 --> 00:05:50.987
&gt;&gt; Sandra: HOPEFULLY HE REACHES

